NOTICE ON MARKET DATA AND RESEARCH CLAIMS

This repository contains a verification/audit of research strategies. It is
published for reproducibility and review. Nothing in it is investment advice,
a trading recommendation, or a claim of future performance. The measured hit
rates are retrospective, in-sample or pooled measurements on a
survivorship-biased universe with no transaction costs, slippage, limit-up
unfillability filter, or point-in-time index membership. See README.md §8.

The strategy source under `experts/` is vendored from a third-party research
bundle solely to verify it; see README.md §3 for the reproduction result.
